  "published": "2026-10-03T18:43:10.8Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0: Adds first-class Azure Key Vault-backed `IAutoAuthKeyRotationHandler` implementation and DI registration extension (`AddAutoAuthAzureKeyVaultKeyRotation`), plus production configuration wiring and validation tests. 1.4.0: Adds production-ops hardening with queryable session operations (paging/filtering), optional session metadata capture hooks for tenant/IP/user-agent, resilient key-rotation startup/failure-threshold tuning, and an advanced end-to-end operations sample. 1.3.0: Adds operational hardening features including session inventory/targeted revocation APIs, session metadata capture (tenant/IP/user-agent), resilient key-rotation scheduling controls (startup execution + failure threshold), and stricter lifetime validation. 1.2.0: Add advanced feature hooks: passkeys flag, multi-tenant resolver, risk-based token evaluation hook, session/compliance sinks, and built-in telemetry counters/activities around token endpoint execution. 1.1.0: Add fluent RequirePushedAuthorizationRequests() support for OpenIddict PAR enforcement, exposing /connect/par for authorization_code deployments. 1.0.1: Add missing package icon. 1.0.0: Initial release. Fluent AddAutoAuthServer/AddAutoAuthValidation configuration wrappers over OpenIddict, an idempotent client seeder (AutoAuthClientSeeder), and a ready-made client_credentials token endpoint (MapAutoAuthClientCredentialsEndpoint). Interactive flows (authorization_code with user login) require your own login/consent endpoint — see README.",
